<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>404 · {{ meta.siteName }}</title>
    <link href="/styles/digital-garden-base.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    {%- if meta.themeStyle -%}
    <link href="/styles/obsidian-base.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="{{ meta.themeStyle }}" rel="stylesheet" />
    {%- else -%}
    <link href="/styles/style.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    {%- endif -%}
    <link href="/styles/custom-style.css" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body class="theme-{{ meta.baseTheme }} not-found-page">
    <div class="not-found-page__glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <main class="not-found-page__inner">
      <p class="not-found-page__code" aria-label="错误 404">404</p>
      <h1 class="not-found-page__title">未找到此页面</h1>
      <p class="not-found-page__lead">
        链接可能已过期、笔记未公开，或地址输入有误。你可以从下面返回主站首页或进入数字花园。
      </p>
      <nav class="not-found-page__actions" aria-label="页面导航">
        <a class="not-found-page__btn not-found-page__btn--primary" href="/">主站首页</a>
        <a class="not-found-page__btn" href="{{ meta.gardenHomeUrl }}">数字花园</a>
      </nav>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
